r cet agent de voyage. \u00c0 plus&nbsp;! <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : \u00c0 la prochaine !", "time": "35000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de voyages.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux dire ce que je veux faire.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de mes passe-temps et de mes int\u00e9r\u00eats.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "O\u00f9 aimerais-tu aller en vacances&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Qu'aimerais-tu faire en vacances&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Publicit\u00e9s de voyage ! Quels endroits elles promotionnent ?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Coraline et Charlotte parlent d'<span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">aller en voyage</span> et de <span 